WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.160
I found it! Over there!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.660
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.390
Ketsu!

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.600
What were you thinking?!

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:12.830
You'll need extra lives if
you keep fighting like that...

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.770
Yoshi, you've got to stay quick
during a challenge!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.380
Hey, Tokine, are you okay?

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.890
High school student Yukimura Tokine and
junior high student Sugimura Yoshimori

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.820
are ordinary students by day.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.860
But at night, their mission is to
protect the Karasumori Site,

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.190
where the school now stands.
From the Ayakashi.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.090
I will become stronger!

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.830
I never want to see her hurt again!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.590
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:02.460
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:07.660
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.560
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.000
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.400
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:20.940
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:24.280
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:29.950
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.450
Sha la la la la...

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:40.860
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.830
(Secret romance)

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:48.040
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.800
(A strange distance)

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:56.640
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.710
Yeah

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:01.180
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.790
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:10.120
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.120
The weather is so nice today.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.410
One two! One two! One-!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.680
I saved you the trouble of
washing your face.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.560
You dirty hag!

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:45.160
How dare you call me a hag!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.690
Ketsu!

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.460
Ketsu!

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.630
What do you think of that?!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:56.470
Kai.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.840
How do you like that?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.680
Silence!

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.540
You got some in my nose, you water troll!

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.280
- Toshimori, can you go...
- You shut up,

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.680
- and wake up Yoshimori?
- You bug-eyed geezer!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.150
I don't want to.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.310
Yoshi has a Kekkai around himself.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:14.120
That Kekkai is only for Grandpa,
so it shouldn't work on you.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.520
You know that.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.060
Then why don't you go
wake him up, Dad?

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.260
I'm going to feed Madarao!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:22.700
Yoshimori.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.530
Yoshimori! Wake up or
you'll be late for school.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.230
Yoshimori!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.380
You fool! I can read
your movements like a book!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.920
You senile old geezer!

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.360
Hm?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:01.870
Hey Toshimori. Maybe you should
stop with the dog food.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.910
But Grandpa said that it's the founder's dog,
so we have to take good care of it.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.340
Ayakashi don't eat stuff like that.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:12.580
Ugh, you're not taking care of Madarao,
so I'm doing it for you.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.880
Ayakashi feed on
acts of thoughtfulness like this!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.850
Thoughtfulness?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.780
I got more where that came from!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.460
Good grief... I know we've worked
together for a long time

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:30.160
but I don't know much
about that dog...

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.700
but I know even less
about Karasumori.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.710
I never thought I'd see you with
a meek look on your face.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.570
Did you eat something weird?

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.910
Tokine, what exactly is Karasumori?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.020
Ayakashi come into the site
and they transform...

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:51.820
I understand that part,
but I get the feeling that there's more to it.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.020
Don't get too curious about it.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:59.220
That site is much scarier than you think.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:06.560
Really? I never felt the place was scary.
Not even once.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.250
Who was that again?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.430
Yuri!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.000
Good morning, Kyoko-chan.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.600
Spare the greeting!

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.770
There was a huge accident here last week.
You need to be careful too.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.810
Oh really?

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:56.120
Kyoko! Yuri!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.740
That cherry blossom is blooming
out of season again!

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.080
- What?!
- What?!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:05.160
It's one of the 77 Wonders
of Karasumori Academy.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:07.660
The cherry blossom tree
that blooms out of season!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:11.930
Why don't we buy some juice and have
a cherry blossom viewing at lunch later?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.030
That sounds great!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.570
Huh?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.730
That person down there...

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.770
Say, I wonder who that is?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.540
- Who?
- Who?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.670
See? The person by the tree.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.770
- What?
- What?

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.520
Oh, it's just Sumimura.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.280
What is he doing all alone?
Some kind of one-man show?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.550
Alone?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.260
So you two can't see her?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.750
Then that means!

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.590
That girl was a ghost.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.400
That was close!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.240
Now open your textbooks to page 48.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.210
I better be more careful.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:58.540
Thanks to Sumimura-kun being there
they didn't look at me funny.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.740
Wait! Sumimura-kun was
talking to the ghost.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:08.490
He can see it! Sumimura-kun
can definitely see them!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.780
He really does sleep a lot.
Oh he woke up.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:20.870
What's wrong, Kanda?

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:24.100
Huh?! Uh... N-Nothing.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.410
I told you to get out of here.
Why did you come back?

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.780
I wanted someone to listen to me.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.990
That's why I gave you directions
to the counseling center.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.300
I want you to listen to me.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.590
I can't do anything even if I listen.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.330
Why... not?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:59.170
If only I wasn't involved in that accident,
then I could come to school like you.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:03.700
Stop it. I feel sorry for you,
but you're already dead.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.550
It's unforgivable!
I hate all that are living!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.780
I'm going to curse every single
student in this school!

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.790
Stop it. If you start acting up,
I'm going to have to destroy you.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.860
Do you want to be erased?

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:31.130
What is he doing to that ghost?
Just who is he?

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:32.910
Don't cry.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:37.210
I'm sure Mother-san at the Smiling Psychic
Counseling Center will help you.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.290
He's definitely dangerous.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.920
He had such an evil-looking face...

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.920
Maybe he's not human!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.030
When he laughs
he looks like a zombie!

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.450
O-Offerings?!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.270
I paid you your fee.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:16.480
Now give me some information
about Yukimura Tokine.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.540
What do you want to know?

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.550
First. What are her hobbies?

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:23.180
But more importantly, I want to know
what her taste in men is.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:24.960
Her hobby is to study.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.050
I don't know anything else.

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.790
This is a huge breach in contract.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.560
I'm going to collect a fine.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.600
Hey!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.310
Tabata... Chugged it in three seconds.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.700
M-My coffee milk...

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:44.470
Pitiful.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:46.800
Tokine!

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:51.550
Do you want to eat lunch together?

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.420
Everyone's getting together under the
cherry blossom in the junior high school yard.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.060
Sorry, I'm on duty
so maybe next time.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.150
Oh. Come on...

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.560
You're so serious.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:09.670
Huh?

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.030
Do you know how cherry blossoms are
associated with people of noble birth?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.350
It's perfect for me seeing
how sweet and elegant I am.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.610
Ew! Mao is already there.
I changed my mind.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.320
If I eat over there
I'll have indigestion.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.690
With the cherry blossom
blooming out of season,

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.450
looks like I'll be working
through the night again.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:34.530
I knew it.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.690
The high schoolers already
took all the spots.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.700
But this area is in
the junior high school zone.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.540
I guess there's nothing we can do.

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.160
The high schoolers have to
bring their own lunch.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.360
That just sucks.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.740
Then why don't we come
when there are no people?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.060
- What?
- What?

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.000
How about viewing
the blossoms at night?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.330
But...

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.440
That sounds like an idea!

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:55.470
But we're not allowed
in the school at night.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.980
You're scared, aren't you?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.650
But it's against the school rules.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.190
What are you talking about?!
School rules are made to be broken!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.290
Then it's set. How about we
meet here at midnight?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.690
What? M-Midnight?!

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:11.700
Hey, you there!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.940
You better not do anything stupid!

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:16.970
The school is a really
dangerous place at night!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.140
- What?
- What?

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:22.540
I, uh... A-Anyway, don't go near
the school at night!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.480
You got that? Bye.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.250
- What was that?
- I don't get him!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:34.680
- He's really weird.
- Yeah. He is.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.320
That's not what I meant.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:39.860
He's not normal.
Like... he's not human.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:43.490
Oh. What. Yuri?!
Is this your spiritual mumbo jumbo again?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.820
N-No. I...

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.000
Uh-oh!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.430
What? What? Does he have some
weird ghost possessing him?

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.770
N-No...

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:56.240
If they find out that I can see ghosts
they'll definitely think I'm weird.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:00.780
It's beautiful...

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:04.710
Why does this cherry blossom keep
blooming like this?

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:10.420
The lord really loved cherry blossoms
and flashy stuff too.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:14.930
So it's more like it's being forced
to bloom out of season.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.160
Yeah. Master Tokimori said
something like that too.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:19.970
The cherry blossoms of Karasumori

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:22.130
have the power to make anyone
who gazes upon them excited.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.230
Oh really?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:26.810
That's one of the key features
of Karasumori.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.240
Key features, huh?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.740
I just don't get it though.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:36.180
Doesn't he fear the strong power
of Karasumori?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.180
Now then.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.660
I doubt that they will be coming,
but I'd better make sure.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:49.760
I can't tell if he's a man of high caliber
or just plain oblivious.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.130
I'm going to get more wrinkles now.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:58.100
I guess I came too early.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.910
Oh well. I'll just go in
from the back entrance.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:02.770
Ketsu!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:07.840
All right! Now no one can come in.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.430
What's this strange feeling?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.730
Oh, you're already here, Kyoko-chan?

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.450
What is this?!

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:53.420
Metsu!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.240
Why did you come?!
And how did you get in here?

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.270
The back entrance.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:09.280
Back entrance? Damn it!
I forgot to place a Kekkai there.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.580
Yoshimori. What are you
going to do with her?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.980
Of all the times
you could let someone in,

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.420
it had to be the night
the cherry blossom is blooming?

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.270
I tried to stop her.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.350
This is your mistake.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.580
Anyway! Kanda, hurry up and go...

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:25.720
Looks like they're here, Yoshimori.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.390
You come over here!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:35.800
Ketsu!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.960
Don't even move an inch!
You got that?!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:39.930
Huh? I...

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:44.210
Hey, are you sure you should get her
involved like this?

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.970
We don't really have
a choice right now.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.920
You're going to
take responsibility for this.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:53.250
The Hazama Style emphasizes
not causing trouble for normal people.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:57.780
It's all right. Regular people can't
see any of this anyway.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:01.620
Here they come.
The real guests for the flower-viewing.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:06.290
W-What is that?

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.140
Hoi!

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.140
Joso!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:19.480
Ketsu!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.940
You're wasting your strength again!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.610
It's faster this way!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.480
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:32.220
See? You've got so many slipping through.

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.490
Oh, shut up.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:36.560
- Metsu!
- Metsu!

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:43.660
They just keep
coming and coming.

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:46.840
W-What are these people?!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:04.520
Metsu!

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.820
They're completely drunk.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.030
Hey Madarao!
What are you doing?!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.300
Stop screwing around
while I'm working!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.270
Eating these small fries under
the spell of the cherry blossom

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.300
is one of the only ways
I can have fun now.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.270
Don't you get all excited!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.180
It's the cherry blossom of Karasumori.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.510
Can you really blame me?

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.380
It may be because
I'm also an Ayakashi.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.520
I'm going to destroy you if
you transform and go crazy!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.360
Don't think of me as
the same as these small fries.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.260
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:39.680
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.190
This is such a huge pain!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:49.830
Tokine! Take care of this area!

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:50.970
What?!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:51.800
Hoi!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:54.100
Joso!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.540
Wait. Yoshimori!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:57.840
Ketsu!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.780
Oh, so that's what you wanted to do...

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.580
You always try to take care
of these things with force.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.160
Don't you remember
how you passed out

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.290
after using up your powers
when you were younger?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.890
Yeah, I completely forgot about it!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.290
Now...

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.800
...let's finish them off!

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:21.170
Ketsu!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:23.560
Metsu!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.160
- Tenketsu!
- Tenketsu!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:40.420
Looks like we took care
of most of them.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.220
Oh yeah...

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.330
Do you want to be erased?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:57.730
I-I'm going to get erased?

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.670
Kai. Okay, you can move now...

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.810
H-Hey! What's wrong?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:05.740
Uh-oh! Looks like you made her cry.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:12.510
I'm sorry. He's been rough with you.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.520
You're scaring her.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.260
Shut up! You do something about this.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.920
I knew it.

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.890
She has spiritual powers.

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:29.900
- What?!
- It means she saw everything.

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.830
What?!

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.200
Oh. Uh...

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:39.570
S-Sorry. I didn't know that
you could see it...

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.280
I don't see these things
because I want to.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.940
Are you all right with this,
Sumimura-kun?

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:47.180
That you have these strange powers?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.550
Huh?

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.490
You don't mind it?

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.620
Mind it?
This is normal for me.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:59.060
My dad doesn't have these spiritual powers
and he's the one that sticks out in our family.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:18:59.990
Oww!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.230
How is that supposed to help?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.630
Because of this ability...

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.640
I have seen many scary things
since I was little.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:11.370
But I couldn't tell anyone,
no matter how scared I was.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:16.150
I don't want this ability.
I wish it would just go away.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:23.090
Hey, you know how there are
all sorts of people in this world?

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:28.600
Like people that are good at picking up girls
or people who can chug milk really fast.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.360
Ow!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:33.130
That hurt!
What was that for. Tokine?!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.200
You're not helping the situation!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:38.210
You're the one that told me
to do something about it!

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:40.800
So why bring up picking up girls
and milk?!

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.940
It's just an example.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:51.620
I've always hated this ability
and I wanted to be normal.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.580
I don't get it.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:54.350
Huh?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:59.620
Well, that cherry blossom is also weird,
but it's pretty when it's blooming.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.860
And everyone loves looking at it.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.860
A cherry blossom is a cherry blossom.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.150
That fact doesn't change.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:15.500
Kai!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.410
I know I got you involved
and everything,

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:23.210
but can you keep this
a secret from everyone?

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:26.680
I won't tell anyone.
They wouldn't believe me anyway.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:28.150
I guess so.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.390
Hey Kanda. Tell me the next time
you see something weird.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:37.360
Huh?

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:42.760
I can't erase your powers, but I can do
something about ghosts and Ayakashi.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:45.630
That's part of my job.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.440
Your job? Sumimura-kun?

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.440
Yeah. It's like exorcizing evil spirits.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:52.680
Oh.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.720
Sorry, but I still have some work to do,
so I can't walk you home.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:59.810
So can you keep this a secret too?

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:09.390
Sumimura-kun is strange.
But I'm just as strange.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.190
Can you walk a little faster?

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:16.900
But I wonder why I feel so happy?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.800
This is where I live.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:22.600
Thanks for walking me
all the way back here.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:50.760
What happened yesterday?

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.130
W-What do you mean?

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.440
Uh-oh. I completely forgot about them.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:22:01.340
The gate wouldn't budge,
so we couldn't go inside.

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:03.950
We couldn't go over the wall either.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:08.860
You never showed up and it was too cold,
so we ended up just going home.

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:12.380
I-I also gave up and went home.

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:14.950
Then how come
we couldn't see each other?

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.960
I-I wonder why!
That's so strange.

00:22:18.300 --> 00:22:19.660
U-Um...

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:26.060
Th-This could be one of
the 77 Wonders of Karasumori Academy!

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:28.270
Sounds suspicious to me.

00:22:28.310 --> 00:22:30.470
Tell us the truth!

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:33.210
Help me Sumimura-kun!

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:37.380
Kyoko-chan and Ayano-chan
are scarier than the Ayakashi!

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:46.390
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.390 --> 00:22:53.100
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:02.480
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:08.810
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:18.660
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:25.020
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:34.110
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:41.640
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:50.620
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:59.190
The red string connects one to another
